# ==============================================================================
# MedVault AI Assistant - Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# To enable live Google Gemini 2.5 AI responses in the Patient Assistant:
# 1. Obtain a free API key from Google AI Studio: https://aistudio.google.com/
# 2. Copy this file to '.env.local' (which is automatically gitignored)
# 3. Paste your Gemini API key below:
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
